      "message": "feat(ui): Debug info window with a Copy button, opened from the status strip\n\nA bug glyph at the status strip's right end opens a \"Debug info\" window:\nversion and build, OS/arch, GPU adapter, project path, units, machine,\ndocument counts with operation status and the last status line, as\nplain text with a Copy button. The shell snapshots move by the new\nglyph only.\n\nFixes #157\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
