        "date": "2026-11-08T15:38:23Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): the Debug info door stays on the strip under a long status line\n\nWith main's status line (#232's body-ink label, a long generate summary)\nthe left-to-right label pushed the right-hand widgets - the Debug info\nglyph and the faint shell label - off the strip. The right-hand widgets\nare now laid out first and the status line takes the remaining width,\ntruncated, keeping its hover text and \"Copy message\". The glyph is\ntinted with the body ink so it reads on the light theme (it is white at\nload, as the ribbon's glyphs are).\n\nRefs #157\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
